course: dictionary
lesson: 8243
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and context tells you which one the writer means. «Rheas are big flightless birds of South America, cousins of ostriches and emus.» Here a rhea is an animal, because the sentence tells you it is a bird with feathers and a family.
explain: Capital letters and the topic are clues too. Rhea can be a name, as in Greek myths, where Rhea was a Titan and the mother of Zeus. The subject of the sentence, such as myths, space or animals, tells you which meaning fits.
explain: Check your choice by putting the meaning into the sentence. A rhea father sits on eggs, which makes sense for the bird, but a girl's name does not sit on eggs. If it does not fit, try another meaning.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: Rhea has three meanings: a large South American bird, a Titan in Greek myths, and a moon of Saturn.
fact: A rhea is a large flightless bird from South America, like a small ostrich or emu, with long legs, and it runs fast.
fact: «A rhea father sits on eggs laid by several females, sometimes over 50.»
fact: Rhea is also the second-largest moon of Saturn, and it is a girl's name too.
exercise: «Rheas are big flightless birds of South America, cousins of ostriches and emus.» What is a rhea in this sentence? | *A large bird that cannot fly | A large South American river | A kind of fast car | A mountain in South America
exercise: In Greek myths, Rhea was a Titan, the mother of Zeus. What kind of word is Rhea here? | *A name, from a figure in Greek myths | A bird from South America | A type of food | A colour
exercise: «Zoos can mix capybaras, rheas, tapirs and anteaters.» What is a rhea in this sentence? | A type of tree | *An animal, a big bird | A kind of food | A zoo keeper
test: «A rhea father sits on eggs laid by several females.» Who sits on the eggs? | The chicks | *The father | The zookeeper | The mother
test: Rhea is the second-largest moon of which planet? | *Saturn | Jupiter | Mars | Earth
exam: Rhea has three meanings. Which meaning is a large bird that runs fast but cannot fly? | Rhea the moon | Rhea the Titan | Rhea the girl's name | *The South American bird
